      "patch": {
        "title": "避免无效 examine 与盲目穷举",
        "principle": "不要使用 examine 或 look at 作为搜索动作；若已检查大量容器仍未找到目标，应重新评估可见承载面或目标是否存在，而不是继续盲目穷举。",
        "when_to_apply": "当搜索目标物体遇到失败或长时间未找到时。"
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_069"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_005",
      "patch": {
        "title": "避免重复无效动作",
        "principle": "当动作返回“Nothing happens”时，不要重复同一动作；应改变状态（如打开/关闭容器、移动位置、取出物体）后再重试。若 go to 目标返回“Nothing happens”，视为不可达并切换到其他候选位置。",
        "when_to_apply": "当任何动作返回“Nothing happens”且未改变环境状态时。"
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_123"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_006",
      "patch": {
        "title": "避免在未确认成功前声明完成",
        "principle": "不要输出完成状态或停止行动，直到环境观察确认最终放置动作成功；过早声明完成可能导致任务失败。成功 put 后立即停止，不要发出 inventory 或空动作。",
        "when_to_apply": "在执行最终放置动作后。"
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_052"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_007",
      "patch": {
        "principle": "对于“examine/look at X with/under the desklamp”类任务，先定位目标物体和台灯，若目标可携带则拿起目标，移动到台灯所在位置，然后使用台灯（use desklamp <id>）完成观察。若目标物体已在台灯所在家具上，先拿起目标再使用台灯。"
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_027"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_009",
      "patch": {
        "description": "台灯是固定在桌面或边桌上的物体，不是可导航的位置；执行 `go to desklamp 1` 会返回“Nothing happens”，应直接在当前台灯所在位置使用 `use desklamp <id>`。若 `use desklamp` 返回“Nothing happens”，检查是否使用了正确的编号 id 并确认位于台灯所在家具处。"
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_029"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_010",
      "patch": {
        "description": "台灯是固定物体，无法被拿起；执行 `take desklamp 1` 会返回“Nothing happens”，应改为将目标物体带到台灯处或直接使用台灯。使用物品时需使用观察中显示的精确编号 id（如 `take alarmclock 1 from desk 1`、`use desklamp 1`），无编号形式会返回“Nothing happens”。"
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_031"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_011",
      "patch": {
        "principle": "For clean-then-place goals, execute a stable loop: locate the target object (verify it matches the goal noun exactly), take it, go to a sinkbasin or bathtubbasin, clean it, then go to the destination receptacle, open it if closed, and put the object in/on it."
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_052"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_013",
      "patch": {
        "description": "If the destination receptacle is closed, open it before attempting to put the clean object in/on it. If open returns 'Nothing happens', the container may already be open—proceed directly to put rather than looping on open."
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_055"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_014",
      "patch": {
        "principle": "For heat-and-place tasks, after locating the target object and the microwave, take the object, go to the microwave, open it if closed, then execute `heat <object> with microwave 1` while holding the object. If the first heat attempt returns 'Nothing happens', take the object out of the microwave and retry `heat <object> with microwave 1` while holding it. Do not attempt to heat using non-microwave appliances (stoveburner, toaster, coffeemachine); these return 'Nothing happens'."
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_095"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_015",
      "patch": {
        "principle": "Only proceed to the placement step after an observation explicitly confirms heating, such as 'You heat the <object> using the microwave 1.' If heating has not been confirmed, continue trying valid heating methods rather than placing the object. Do not declare completion or failure prematurely."
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_086"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_017",
      "patch": {
        "principle": "To cool an object, first go to the fridge and open it, then use the cool action with the fridge while holding the object; do not rely on putting the object into the fridge and taking it out as a substitute for cooling. A cool attempt while not co-located with the open fridge returns 'Nothing happens'."
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_097"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_019",
      "patch": {
        "principle": "When the target object is not in the first few locations, systematically open and check cabinets, drawers, countertops, and other receptacles, keeping track of which have been checked to avoid redundant loops. Prioritize likely food-storage locations (fridge, dining tables, countertops) and re-check visible surfaces before opening dozens of empty cabinets."
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_098"
    },
    {
      "op": "UPDATE",
      "target_role": "Executor",
      "target_skill_id": "skill_020",
      "patch": {
        "principle": "在双物品放置任务中，若一次只能携带一件物品，先找到并拿起第一件目标物品，若目标容器可达则直接放入最终目标容器；若不可达，将其暂存到安全开放表面，再寻找并拿起第二件目标物品，最后将两件物品都放入目标容器。"
      },
      "evidence_ref": "stage2-local-v10-role-partitioned-patch3/generation_02/client_B/episode_118"
    },
    {
